{# Carrossel editorial do painel de marca — Unio Jurídico (login) #}
<div class="auth-story" data-auth-story data-interval="6000">
    <div class="auth-story__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="auth-story__stage" aria-live="polite">
        <article class="auth-story__slide is-active" data-story-slide data-tone="prazos">
            <p class="auth-story__kicker">Prazos críticos</p>
            <h2 class="auth-story__title">O prazo chega antes da surpresa</h2>
            <p class="auth-story__text">Alertas, prioridades e visão do dia no mesmo painel. A equipe age antes do vencimento.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="auth-story__slide" data-story-slide data-tone="processos" hidden>
            <p class="auth-story__kicker">Processos vivos</p>
            <h2 class="auth-story__title">Casos, partes e andamentos sem planilha</h2>
            <p class="auth-story__text">Histórico do cliente e do processo juntos. Menos busca entre pastas, mais foco na estratégia.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="auth-story__slide" data-story-slide data-tone="Sasha" hidden>
            <p class="auth-story__kicker">IA jurídica Sasha</p>
            <h2 class="auth-story__title">Copiloto para prazos, peças e honorários</h2>
            <p class="auth-story__text">Calcule prazos, resuma documentos e tire dúvidas sem sair da rotina do escritório.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="auth-story__slide" data-story-slide data-tone="equipe" hidden>
            <p class="auth-story__kicker">Equipe sincronizada</p>
            <h2 class="auth-story__title">Sócios e assistentes no mesmo fluxo</h2>
            <p class="auth-story__text">Permissões por perfil, portal do cliente e financeiro conectados à operação jurídica.</p>
        </article>
    </div>

    <div class="auth-story__nav" role="tablist" aria-label="Destaques da plataforma">
        <button type="button" class="auth-story__dot is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-label="Prazos críticos" data-story-dot></button>
        <button type="button" class="auth-story__dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-label="Processos vivos" data-story-dot></button>
        <button type="button" class="auth-story__dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-label="IA jurídica Sasha" data-story-dot></button>
        <button type="button" class="auth-story__dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-label="Equipe sincronizada" data-story-dot></button>
    </div>
</div>
